  "description": "Read-aloud engine for Windows (.NET Framework 4.8, no UI framework): grabs the selected text from any app (UI Automation / copy / pointer / clipboard), turns screen text into speech-ready text (symbols, bullets, ALL-CAPS, English words inside Turkish text, user pronunciation dictionary), speaks it with SAPI voices or the offline Turkish neural voice (EMA Lightning on ONNX Runtime) with word-level positions, reads text off the screen with the built-in Windows OCR, translates with MyMemory/DeepL, and ducks other audio. The engine behind the free Sesli Okuma tray app.",
